# LeakSanitizer suppressions for the sanitized core gate.
#
# miniaudio probes backends in priority order and dlopen()s each candidate.
# On a headless box PulseAudio and ALSA both fail, so it reaches JACK: libjack
# runs its C++ static initialisers, miniaudio dlclose()s it once the probe
# fails, and the module is gone by the time LeakSanitizer walks the heap. The
# allocation is JACK's own and unreachable from any code we own, so it cannot
# be freed from here -- only hidden. Nothing in driscord calls into JACK.
leak:ma_context_init__jack
